00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.000
Loodan, et tuharalihased
saavad vatti, Lila ema.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.000
Järgmisena Kevin Brady.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:04.000
Ardinglyst Haywards Heathi,
ma teen su maatasa.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:14.000
Lase käia, Kev!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.000
Lähme?
